ffiTest is test
ffiTest purpose "The C library opens by the name `c` (the runtime's own, on every system), its functions bind by name, a missing function is symbolMissing, a missing library notFound, and a Library closes"
ffiTest verifies ffiOpen loadsLibrary
ffiTest verifies ffiBind bindsSymbol
ffiTest verifies ffiClose closesLibrary
ffiTest typeParameter none
ffiTest input none
ffiTest output none
ffiTest outputOwnedBy none
