ffiTest effect use machine.memory
ffiTest effect use system.calls
ffiTest uses memoryAccess
ffiTest uses systemCalls
ffiTest memoryHeap false
ffiTest async false
ffiTest maxRecursion none
ffiTest label begin loopKind none
ffiTest label begin within none
ffiTest let zero Int64 0 immutable
ffiTest let resultsOffset Int64 62016 immutable
